{"steam_appid":4111370,"steam_name":"Birdwatching Notebook","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4111370/285522915/466803af3c8d179ed5693203e368bba6ad5a4743/1779377279/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1779378263","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257340844/89815b3b3af4e6910439a89775752704ed436f79/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1779378263","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/4f330276b3226e39475e968413e80d7635c2b0be/ss_4f330276b3226e39475e968413e80d7635c2b0be.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786071703","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/9e44445c63af06fdbdf01241b6698211c3f68d9b/ss_9e44445c63af06fdbdf01241b6698211c3f68d9b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786071703","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/c1cfb84c8137421ab0ccbd7fef8eb6af41a304ea/ss_c1cfb84c8137421ab0ccbd7fef8eb6af41a304ea.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786071703","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/9694434ad89c7e284ee7426d76d74d0308374252/ss_9694434ad89c7e284ee7426d76d74d0308374252.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786071703","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/2b6fa6b8ef185751dd092330891ceb1f18ef3a19/ss_2b6fa6b8ef185751dd092330891ceb1f18ef3a19.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786071703"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Birders, assemble!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We've developed a cozy idle game just for you. Now, you can enjoy birdwatching from the comfort of your desktop, too! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Place your postcard — a window to another world — right at the corner of your screen.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate your favourite birding spot to your heart's content. If a bird happens to fancy your humble abode, it just might stop by for a visit!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join us on Discord!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/842c133279bb6a832785420affc28c9f.avif?t=1786071703\" width=1560 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unlock a variety of birding spots! The docks, beaches, deserts, even rainforests…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each place has its own unique scenery, and new bird species to discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/0b2afa50cf03c133f0da7e29561dcc96.poster.avif?t=1786071703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/0b2afa50cf03c133f0da7e29561dcc96.webm?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/0b2afa50cf03c133f0da7e29561dcc96.mp4?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/6406b6bb7f5e988de39d48b5d3bbad47.avif?t=1786071703\" width=1560 height=273 /></span>Your Birding Area can be freely manipulated! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Zoom, move, and arrange your favourite birding spot however you like </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">— the birds will keep you company while you work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/69cd3f1f7b661d040eec7e820ae397a0.poster.avif?t=1786071703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/69cd3f1f7b661d040eec7e820ae397a0.webm?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/69cd3f1f7b661d040eec7e820ae397a0.mp4?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/e139395e7faebb4c936c9d23a716ccfa.poster.avif?t=1786071703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/e139395e7faebb4c936c9d23a716ccfa.webm?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/e139395e7faebb4c936c9d23a716ccfa.mp4?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Blueprint System is now live!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You can save your builds, share them, and quickly switch between different designs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/2eccc13f62de53ba1fc3920bdd5be4c0.avif?t=1786071703\" width=1560 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sparrows aren't the only birds that want to hang out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are dozens of other bird species, too! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">They have their own preferred times to visit — maybe you can capture something wonderful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/060a5ea26a641a9182d93d49003ed570.poster.avif?t=1786071703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/060a5ea26a641a9182d93d49003ed570.webm?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/060a5ea26a641a9182d93d49003ed570.mp4?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The more a bird visits, the more comfortable they'll feel! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You might be able to discover new behaviors over time…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/94367db7b5daf165c1c7f5c7d0fbf489.poster.avif?t=1786071703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/94367db7b5daf165c1c7f5c7d0fbf489.webm?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/94367db7b5daf165c1c7f5c7d0fbf489.mp4?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/1c36e13f70be9829da776e7ffff36c44.avif?t=1786071703\" width=1560 height=273 /></span>Snap! Immortalize your favourite moments with your camera. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Once you've documented every unique behavior from a bird, you'll earn a statue of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/5bd8ca5957edc8a7ab72f8ffa1ea81b2.poster.avif?t=1786071703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/5bd8ca5957edc8a7ab72f8ffa1ea81b2.webm?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/5bd8ca5957edc8a7ab72f8ffa1ea81b2.mp4?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/f2f7f0ee147be1499a56181fb49ad972.poster.avif?t=1786071703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/f2f7f0ee147be1499a56181fb49ad972.webm?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/f2f7f0ee147be1499a56181fb49ad972.mp4?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/2beb3573f2cf07d14881317440a36e66.avif?t=1786071703\" width=1560 height=273 /></span>Any new lifers today?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your handbook also keeps a record of Birding Areas, decoration, photographs, achievements, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/cd53d1c506d539383471866d285fb8a6.poster.avif?t=1786071703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/cd53d1c506d539383471866d285fb8a6.webm?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/cd53d1c506d539383471866d285fb8a6.mp4?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you enlarge the main illustration, you'll be able to discover just what traits make that bird special!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/2f184713cdcde9b90daddd59e7710319.poster.avif?t=1786071703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/2f184713cdcde9b90daddd59e7710319.webm?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/2f184713cdcde9b90daddd59e7710319.mp4?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/b57eade0585864caf56b0673eec34484.avif?t=1786071703\" width=1560 height=273 /></span>You can change the time of day and weather of your Birding Area as you desire. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Regardless of time, or weather, you'll meet a new friend who enjoys it, that's for sure!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/b72ea69471781bb30eb2dcd92b85bf70.poster.avif?t=1786071703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/b72ea69471781bb30eb2dcd92b85bf70.webm?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/b72ea69471781bb30eb2dcd92b85bf70.mp4?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In the night, nocturnal birds await…<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/4975c6b92ad4d227c9f97ae3e02f3d20.poster.avif?t=1786071703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/4975c6b92ad4d227c9f97ae3e02f3d20.webm?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/4975c6b92ad4d227c9f97ae3e02f3d20.mp4?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/70caf8a3e7298ac958d712d362758a69.avif?t=1786071703\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras_big/70caf8a3e7298ac958d712d362758a69.webp?t=1786071703 width=1560 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join your friends for a birdwatching session! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Transform into a little bird and land in your friends’ birdwatching spots, leaving behind emotes, photos, and little gifts as keepsakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/744030c9451ac61a64c49013ab81aada.poster.avif?t=1786071703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/744030c9451ac61a64c49013ab81aada.webm?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/744030c9451ac61a64c49013ab81aada.mp4?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You can also request and collect blueprints of other players’ birdwatching spots, bringing your favorite layout inspirations back to your own Birdland. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/23b64d3b79bff07cf8e66b738a5540bb.avif?t=1786071703\" width=1560 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your bird friends will bring all sorts of trinkets for you to collect! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">They'll drop all sorts of colorful feathers, and maybe more…<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/1c280ba5bacf6b09e6913755f3338a3b.poster.avif?t=1786071703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/1c280ba5bacf6b09e6913755f3338a3b.webm?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/1c280ba5bacf6b09e6913755f3338a3b.mp4?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/5a98e5e473a02c596752af5a51018f91.avif?t=1786071703\" width=1560 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Boss Crow loves anything that sparkles — whether it be shimmering feathers, or the bright glint of bottle caps! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">He'll return the favor in Crow Coins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/282cff83ed12d9b2133a8b275aba0aab.poster.avif?t=1786071703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/282cff83ed12d9b2133a8b275aba0aab.webm?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/282cff83ed12d9b2133a8b275aba0aab.mp4?t=1786071703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>More features are under development: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>you'll be able to share gorgeous birding spots with your friends, and more…</strong></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 3000<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Casual"],"developers":["Biekka Games"],"publishers":["Biekka Games"],"release_date":"May 26, 2026"}